                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.00/831.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-04-11">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 11, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Senate elected Bordas yesterday for the third time. Today the House rejected
                    him, 15 to 9, and later voted Jiménez, 8; Vásquez, 8; Velásquez, 5.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Curtis</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
